{"id":"71ede582cb78a069","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-elementary-substructure.md","title":"Elementary Substructure","display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-elementary-substructure","aliases":["17-df-elementary-substructure"],"display":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure","depends_on":["[[17-df-first-order-language]]","[[17-df-structure]]","[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]"],"source_section":"3.1","source_result":"elementary-submodel convention","source_pages_print":[136],"source_pages_djvu":[152],"source_verification":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation","label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-1.4.3"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-elementary-substructure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-elementary-substructure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-elementary-substructure — Elementary Substructure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"3.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"elementary-submodel convention"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>136</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>152</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; local equivalent formulation"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-1.4.3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span> (first-order language, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dab75c9f48db057d\" href=\"?note=dab75c9f48db057d\" title=\"17-df-first-order-language\">17-df-first-order-language</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}\\)</span> (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\">\\(L\\)</span>-structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" href=\"?note=fdac06af5a7f3bb5\" title=\"17-df-structure\">17-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\">\\(\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L\\)</span> (elementary embeddings, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"16340c2187670288\" href=\"?note=16340c2187670288\" title=\"17-df-elementary-embedding\">17-df-elementary-embedding</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\">\\(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}\\)</span> 是下式定义的函数图；图的定义不以载体包含为前提，作为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\">\\(|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\)</span> 的映射则要求下式给出的包含条件。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L\">\\(\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L\\)</span> (relations defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,a):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|&amp;\\to\\bigl(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\bigr),\\\\[1mm]\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n|\\mathfrak{A}|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{B}|\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}=c^{\\mathfrak{B}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathfrak{B}}(\\bar a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}=R^{\\mathfrak{B}}\\cap|\\mathfrak{A}|^n),\\\\[1mm]\n\\mathfrak{A}\\preceq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\land\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}}\n\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(a,a):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|&amp;\\to\\bigl(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\bigr),\\\\[1mm]\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n|\\mathfrak{A}|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{B}|\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}=c^{\\mathfrak{B}})\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathfrak{B}}(\\bar a))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}=R^{\\mathfrak{B}}\\cap|\\mathfrak{A}|^n),\\\\[1mm]\n\\mathfrak{A}\\preceq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&amp;\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\land\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}}\n\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The Tarski--Vaught witness criterion is equivalent to the second clause but is a\ntheorem, not an additional defining equation; it is therefore not folded into this\ndefinition atom.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-first-order-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-elementary-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-first-order-language","status":"resolved","id":"dab75c9f48db057d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$L$ (first-order language, see [[17-df-first-order-language]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"fdac06af5a7f3bb5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}$ ($L$-structures, see [[17-df-structure]])","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-elementary-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"16340c2187670288","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L$ (elementary embeddings, see [[17-df-elementary-embedding]])","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}","display":false},{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}","display":false},{"tex":"|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|","display":false},{"tex":"\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}&\\coloneqq\\{(a,a):a\\in|\\mathfrak A|\\},\\\\\n|\\mathfrak A|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak B|&\\to\\bigl(\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}:|\\mathfrak A|\\to|\\mathfrak B|\\bigr),\\\\[1mm]\n\\quad\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n|\\mathfrak{A}|\\subseteq|\\mathfrak{B}|\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_L\\;(c^{\\mathfrak{A}}=c^{\\mathfrak{B}})\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_{L,n}\\;\n\\forall\\bar a\\in|\\mathfrak{A}|^n\\;\n(f^{\\mathfrak{A}}(\\bar a)=f^{\\mathfrak{B}}(\\bar a))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall n\\in\\omega\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_{L,n}\\;\n(R^{\\mathfrak{A}}=R^{\\mathfrak{B}}\\cap|\\mathfrak{A}|^n),\\\\[1mm]\n\\mathfrak{A}\\preceq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;&\n\\mathfrak{A}\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak{B}\n\\land\n\\iota_{\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}}\n\\in\\operatorname{ElemEmb}_L(\\mathfrak{A},\\mathfrak{B}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2216,"backlinks":[{"id":"cbea1b33aeed1412","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 是集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 是候选严格序。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathfrak B$ 是候选结构。\n$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 及载体投影见 [[17-df-structure]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。\n$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]；族 $(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 采用该依赖链中的函数图编码。"},{"id":"9a564fd35615a768","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L\\in\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$，$I$ 为集合，${<}\\subseteq I\\times I$ 为候选关系。\n$F$ 是定义域为 $I$ 的集合函数，$\\mathfrak A_i=F(i)$；$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-structure]]。\n$\\preceq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{StrictLinearOrder}$ 见 [[17-df-linear-order]]。\n$\\operatorname{ElemChain}_L$ 的定义包括索引序与各分量的类型检验；此谓词允许空索引集。"},{"id":"d800620e6f7db9a2","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$ 为同一语言的结构。$\\preceq_L$ 是 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]] 的初等子结构关系。以下定义 $\\operatorname{ElemExt}_L$，参数依次为扩张结构、原结构。"},{"id":"5dbb6e8d985aff7a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ ($L$-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"fc4d04472af291f6","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ (substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"bfb69740eadd1eee","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A=(A,\\mathcal I)\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$\\varnothing\\ne X\\subseteq A$；语言分量见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]，子结构关系见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。$B_{\\mathfrak A}(X)$ 为生成载体，$\\langle X\\rangle_{\\mathfrak A}$ 为下面构造的语言结构。"},{"id":"aa3ceab2a7aa2799","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6495b9aaef839e12","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathscr L$ 为 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的语义接口，$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$L,L_0,L'\\in\\mathcal V$；子语言、约化、符号重命名及结构拉回见 [[17-df-reduct]]、[[17-df-language-operations]]。普通子结构见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]，一阶句子见 [[17-df-sentence]]；$\\operatorname{Inj}$、有限性见 [[17-df-set-functions]]、[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]。$P\\notin\\Sigma_L$ 是新的一元关系符号；$L^P$ 在下式构造，$\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L^P)$ 时 $D_P^{\\mathfrak M}$ 是 $P$ 的元素层解释。下面的每个性质是关于固定接口 $S_{\\mathscr L},E_{\\mathscr L}$ 的形式模式。相对化仅对有限非逻辑符号语言要求；若 $D_P^{\\mathfrak M}$ 为空或不承载原语言的子结构，则其相对化句为假。"},{"id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L$ (substructure and elementary-substructure relations, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"6dababec25b1b858","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"d88aa28a0fcc379a","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$，$D\\subseteq|\\mathfrak A|$；$\\preceq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]。"},{"id":"105ca7a585f377f9","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$L$ 是固定的一阶语言，$T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。$\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$、$\\mathrm{Mod}(T)$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[17-df-model]]；$\\subseteq_L$ 见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-chain-union]]。\n量化的指标 $I$ 为集合，$<$ 为其二元关系，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 为定义域恰为 $I$ 的结构族；$\\operatorname{ChainUnion}_L$ 已要求非空线序及相容子结构链。以下引入二个以理论为参数的元语言谓词。"},{"id":"7aaf4c313fa6fd4d","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ (substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"d41b5929d20d010d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"288977f8607c0661","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ is from [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]."},{"id":"7b8a12056c44415b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ ($L$-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"67c0bbaaadf7a9b6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ ($L$-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"903e38bc688a0a59","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L,\\preceq_L$ (substructure and elementary-substructure relations, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"b71a35c07e472b22","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"d7469176894ed5c8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ (substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"3a83277d3d1f3b48","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"878c65aa33f0602e","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"f1df199971137c9e","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"000da1f2ba1de849","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak A\\subseteq_L\\mathfrak B$，$A=|\\mathfrak A|$、$B=|\\mathfrak B|$，见 [[17-df-elementary-substructure]]；包含映射使用该依赖中定义的 $\\iota_{\\mathfrak A,\\mathfrak B}$。$\\mathrm{Assign}(A)$ 与赋值更新见 [[17-df-assignment]]；$\\mathrm{Sat}_L$、$\\mathrm{Form}_L$ 见 [[17-df-satisfaction]]。"},{"id":"84d09aff18243439","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"c6d785e6b3507274","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\subseteq_L$ (substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"be28d7d574c6b831","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\preceq_L$ (elementary-substructure relation, see [[17-df-elementary-substructure]])"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor